        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "N. Annual contract teachers who otherwise would have been recommended for reappointment shall not fail to be reappointed because of a reduced allocation of teaching units at their school. Teachers so affected will be given a districtwide appointment as a teacher for the following year. Final assignments will be made as soon as practical, but in no case later than August 1. This provision shall not preclude the district from hiring outside applicants during the period in which teachers are unassigned.",
